                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/coherent+category"} coherent category
                satisfying the
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/axiom+of+finiteness"} axiom of finiteness
                is a well-pointed topos equivalent to
                = succeed "." do
